ng-orang yang takwa."},{"resource_id":999,"language_name":"gorontalo","text":"Tutuulio-tutu daatalio lo hula-hulalaala, diya-diyanu-he to tili lo Allah, de'uwito-wito mopulu wau duulo Hula. (debo odelo) uma pilidudutiomai lo Allah, to'u Tio lopowalimai lo hulungaa wau huta, to woolota lio woluo wopato hula-hulalaala u molamahu. Uwitolo (pidudutio) lo aagama motulidu, yio eleehia limongoli u mongarinaya batanga limo-ngoli to delomo (u wopato hula) boito, wau potuuhui limongoli ta hipopoduulude mo'aa'amilala debo odelo timongolio heloliluhe olimongoli mo'aa'amila, wau ototaaima'o limogoli tutuulio-tutu Allah wolo ta hipotolotakowaawa."}]}],"pagination":{"per_page":5,"current_page":1,"next_page":null,"total_pages":1,"total_records":5}}